      },
      {
        "name": "Activity Entry Screen",
        "description": "After logging in, the user can select a sport or physical activity from a dropdown or list (e.g., running, cycling, swimming). They should enter the amount of time (in minutes or hours) they spent on the activity. The screen displays the user's name, their previous activities (with sport, date, and duration), and has a button to submit/save the new activity."
